m\" style=\"background-color:#36220c\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-space-between is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c73042ca wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light has-custom-content-position is-position-top-right wp-container-content-ceb7f5b3 wp-duotone-rgb137750-rgb210210210-1\" style=\"padding-top:4vw;padding-right:4vw;padding-bottom:4vw;padding-left:4vw;min-height:75vh;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://pd.w.org/2023/04/654642d52f20d6367.57324872.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-right is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-06b49a26 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#e5683a;font-size:140px;font-style:normal;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-6px;line-height:0.8;text-transform:uppercase\">Wardell</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#e5683a;font-size:130px;font-style:normal;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-6px;line-height:0.8;text-transform:uppercase\">abu-abu</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#d09c9c;font-size:90px;font-style:normal;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase\">Plays</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#e59937;font-size:90px;font-style:normal;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:0.8;text-transform:uppercase\">Bebop &amp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color wp-block-para